Package: vpngate-client
Version: 1.1-1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, network-manager-openvpn, openvpn, pkexec | policykit-1
Maintainer: Ajang Supardi <ajangsupardi@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: GTK4 client for free VPN Gate servers
 Browse public VPN Gate servers (country, ping, speed, score),
 connect through NetworkManager OpenVPN with legacy-cipher handling,
 and disconnect with full profile/file cleanup.
 .
 Native GNOME interface (GTK4 + libadwaita) with a BMW M-inspired
 dark theme.
